cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Gram-Negative Antigen Triage Pipeline
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - name: Akhil Venkatesh
    email: akhilvenkat197@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/<toasterbath197>/gram-negative-antigen-pipeline"
abstract: >-
  A sequential, resumable pipeline that narrows the unannotated proteins of a
  Gram-negative bacterial genome to a ranked shortlist of candidate vaccine
  antigens using structure, subcellular localization, cross-genome conservation
  and infection-condition expression. Includes an annotation-obsolescence audit
  and built-in negative controls for epitope predictors. Validated on Salmonella
  enterica serovar Typhimurium D23580.
keywords:
  - reverse vaccinology
  - structural bioinformatics
  - AlphaFold
  - Foldseek
  - Salmonella
  - genome annotation
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-13"
